control reproduces; the numbers below are comparable to the rest of the battery

=== 1. stderr = sqrt(accuracy*(1-accuracy)/n): solving for the item count n ===
         benchmark   rows  implied n  rel. spread  max acc  rho(stderr,acc)
          aime2025     95       29.0     8.58e-16   0.3000          +0.9995  <-- all below p=0.5: monotone, so ranking by stderr is EXACT
  arenahardwriting    178     1101.0     7.51e-01   0.8624          +0.9571
          gpqamain    167      447.0     1.02e-15   0.3973          +0.9999  <-- all below p=0.5: monotone, so ranking by stderr is EXACT
             gsm8k    193     1318.0     1.04e-15   0.9121          -0.3198
       healthbench    149      375.0     1.58e+00   0.5667          +0.5111
         humaneval    171      163.0     1.39e-15   0.8537          +0.3553

  953/1175 rows carry a stderr. A constant implied n means the column is
  a deterministic function of the label, not an independent measurement of it.

=== 2. cost under the recommended 5-fold split (top-3 regret, lower is better) ===
 fold  n_test  cover  honest@3  stderr@3  hybrid@3  benchmarks where stderr won on train
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    0     235   89%    0.0231    0.0695    0.0221  aime2025, arenahardwriting, gpqamain
    1     234   94%    0.0469    0.0390    0.0418  aime2025, gpqamain
    2     237   88%    0.0444    0.0454    0.0368  aime2025, arenahardwriting, gpqamain
    3     234   90%    0.0259    0.0137    0.0159  aime2025, arenahardwriting, gpqamain
    4     235   89%    0.0272    0.0263    0.0204  aime2025, arenahardwriting, gpqamain
 POOL    1175           0.0335    0.0388    0.0274

  per benchmark, ranking by stderr alone, pooled over folds:
    aime2025           regret@3 = 0.0000   <-- EXACT, the benchmark is solved
    arenahardwriting   regret@3 = 0.0516
    bfcl               regret@3 = 0.0480
    gpqamain           regret@3 = 0.0000   <-- EXACT, the benchmark is solved
    gsm8k              regret@3 = 0.0574
    healthbench        regret@3 = 0.0295
    humaneval          regret@3 = 0.0849

