          column  cover  regret@3  vs honest    verdict
------------------------------------------------------------
   (honest best)           0.0335             the bar to beat
          stderr   90%    0.0388    +0.0053    no help
  total_cost_usd  100%    0.0378    +0.0043    no help
       num_turns  100%    0.0269    -0.0067      LEAKS
     duration_ms  100%    0.0475    +0.0139    no help
      time_taken  100%    0.0462    +0.0127    no help
   session_count  100%    0.0691    +0.0356    no help

=== 4. all six at once: best of {honest, 6 columns} chosen per benchmark on train ===
 fold  honest@3  attacked@3   column chosen per benchmark
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    0    0.0231      0.0000   aime20=stderr, arenah=stderr, bfcl=num_turns, gpqama=stderr, gsm8k=time_taken, health=duration_ms, humane=total_cost_usd
    1    0.0469      0.0333   aime20=stderr, arenah=total_cost_usd, gpqama=stderr, gsm8k=time_taken, humane=total_cost_usd
    2    0.0444      0.0424   aime20=stderr, arenah=stderr, bfcl=num_turns, gpqama=stderr, gsm8k=total_cost_usd, health=duration_ms, humane=total_cost_usd
    3    0.0259      0.0306   aime20=stderr, arenah=stderr, bfcl=num_turns, gpqama=stderr, gsm8k=time_taken, health=duration_ms, humane=total_cost_usd
    4    0.0272      0.0280   aime20=stderr, arenah=num_turns, bfcl=total_cost_usd, gpqama=stderr, gsm8k=num_turns, health=duration_ms, humane=total_cost_usd
 POOL    0.0335      0.0269

  honest best baseline    regret@3 = 0.0335   headroom +0.0317
  stderr alone                     = 0.0388
  stderr, chosen per benchmark     = 0.0274   headroom +0.0256   (19% destroyed)
  every post-hoc column            = 0.0269   headroom +0.0251   (21% destroyed)

  A split spec that does not name an excluded-columns list is measuring this
  attack, not the thesis. The design survives it -- +0.0251 of headroom
  is still positive -- but the honest headline drops from +0.0317 to +0.0251,
  and on 2 of 7 benchmarks stderr alone is an exact oracle.
